{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wall Town wonders is a cosy life sim where you build a charming town from the ground up, guide quirky characters through delightful quests, and customize every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, build, and fall in love with your town like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dating feature added: choose how you let your Towns Folk date!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/dating.gif?t=1744887806\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Virtual reality cosy life sim city builder:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world where you will experience MR like never before, with unique interactions and highly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/Quests.gif?t=1744887806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gentle and Relaxing Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play, discover, and nurture your town at your own pace in a tranquil and soothing environment, perfect for unwinding and relaxation.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/Bloon.gif?t=1744887806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless Customization and Exploration:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect countless new looks and customization options for your city through gameplay and exploration.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/Airplane.gif?t=1744887806\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570400?t=1744887806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/aa56e79cab648309c4efb0f6ee56ef45a98e5883/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744887806","capsule_image":"htt